   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an investment in a local currency (Nepalese Rupee) green bond issued by NMB Bank in Nepal. This is the first local currency bond issued to international investors by an institution in Nepal, and also the first local currency green bond issued in the country.The green bond investment will support small and medium enterprises involved in climate financing projects, create jobs and accelerate the country&#x2019;s energy transition to support greenhouse gas emissions reduction.</narrative>
